{"turn_id": "d04-t2", "session_id": "d04", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "abstract_outperformance", "text": "摘要指出，实证评估表明该 CNN 方法显著优于基线。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-712a82e231bc15b7c11610b4"}]}, {"key": "conclusion_consistent_outperformance", "text": "结论指出，全部实验结果一致表明，该方法在标准评测数据集上持续优于现有基线方法。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-f45dc29ea469cc573133e3c9"}]}, {"key": "no_numeric_margin", "text": "所给证据仅使用“显著优于”“持续优于”等表述，未提供相对基线的具体数值提升幅度。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-712a82e231bc15b7c11610b4"}, {"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-f45dc29ea469cc573133e3c9"}]}, {"key": "baseline_context", "text": "论文中指出，传统机器学习方法通常使用由 cTAKES 生成的特征构建监督分类器，例如 BluLab 系统从 cTAKES 中提取形态、词汇和句法特征。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}]}, {"key": "competitive_without_ctakes", "text": "作者称，他们的研究证明，不依赖 cTAKES 等领域特定特征抽取工具包也能取得有竞争力的结果。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-f45dc29ea469cc573133e3c9"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d04-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
